WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.435
-Good evening, everybody.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:03.836
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.836 --> 00:00:05.805
And now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.805 --> 00:00:07.807
President Biden said yesterday

00:00:07.807 --> 00:00:09.275
that he doesn't think
the country

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:13.379
is going into a recession
and added, "God willing."

00:00:13.379 --> 00:00:18.351
Aright, well, "God willing" kind
of undercuts the first part.

00:00:18.351 --> 00:00:19.786
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.786 --> 00:00:23.590
That's like saying, "Of course
I'm good to drive, God willing."

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:25.224
[ Laughter ]

00:00:25.224 --> 00:00:28.227
President Biden criticized
former President Trump yesterday

00:00:28.227 --> 00:00:31.530
for his inaction during
the Capitol attack and said,

00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:35.100
"You can't be pro insurrection
and pro democracy."

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:38.070
Oh, that's good. Use logic
on the insurrectionists.

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:39.839
These are people who fly

00:00:39.839 --> 00:00:42.975
a Confederate flag and an
American flag on the same pole.

00:00:42.975 --> 00:00:44.944
One guy showed up to the coup

00:00:44.944 --> 00:00:47.780
dressed like a community college
football mascot.

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:51.784
You really think that guy heard
what you said and thought, "Mm,

00:00:51.784 --> 00:00:54.320
checkmate, Mr. President."

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:55.922
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.922 --> 00:00:57.824
Republican Congressman
Matt Gaetz

00:00:57.824 --> 00:01:01.427
spoke over the weekend at the
conservative Turning Point USA's

00:01:01.427 --> 00:01:03.129
Student Action Summit
in Florida.

00:01:03.129 --> 00:01:05.665
Said Gaetz,
"You had me at 'student.'"

00:01:05.665 --> 00:01:09.335
[ Laughter ]

00:01:09.335 --> 00:01:11.704
Elon Musk reportedly
had an affair

00:01:11.704 --> 00:01:14.073
with Google co-founder
Sergey Brin's wife

00:01:14.073 --> 00:01:15.875
that resulted in
Brin cashing out

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:18.244
of his investments
in Musk's company.

00:01:18.244 --> 00:01:19.779
Musk broke the cardinal rule --

00:01:19.779 --> 00:01:22.949
don't ever mess with a guy who
knows how to check your Gmail.

00:01:22.949 --> 00:01:24.950
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.950 --> 00:01:26.552
A couple in the UK recently had

00:01:26.552 --> 00:01:28.988
a "Back to the Future"
movie-themed wedding,

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:30.756
including
a replica of the DeLorean

00:01:30.756 --> 00:01:34.694
and the creepiest mother-son
dance you've ever seen.

00:01:34.694 --> 00:01:39.932
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.932 --> 00:01:42.601
According to a new book
about Harvey Weinstein,

00:01:42.601 --> 00:01:44.236
the disgraced movie mogul

00:01:44.236 --> 00:01:46.873
smells like feces
and has deformed genitals.

00:01:46.873 --> 00:01:49.275
Even weirder, the book
is an autobiography.

00:01:49.275 --> 00:01:53.179
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.179 --> 00:01:54.881
After singer Adele canceled

00:01:54.881 --> 00:01:56.449
her Las Vegas residency dates

00:01:56.449 --> 00:01:58.117
at Caesars Palace
earlier this year,

00:01:58.117 --> 00:01:59.352
she told her fans yesterday

00:01:59.352 --> 00:02:02.154
that she was "heartbroken
to have to cancel them."

00:02:02.154 --> 00:02:03.722
On the bright side,
that probably means

00:02:03.722 --> 00:02:05.825
you'll hear
a couple of new songs.

00:02:05.825 --> 00:02:07.493
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.493 --> 00:02:08.928
According to a new survey,

00:02:08.928 --> 00:02:13.265
9% of Americans said that they
have no phone numbers memorized.

00:02:13.265 --> 00:02:14.767
Said those people,
"The house is on fire!

00:02:14.767 --> 00:02:18.404
Oh, crap. Let's see.
Oh, uh, 9-1...uh, 4!

00:02:18.404 --> 00:02:20.206
No, 9-1-4?"

00:02:20.206 --> 00:02:23.742
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.742 --> 00:02:26.746
Not the best joke,
but very well acted I think.

00:02:26.746 --> 00:02:29.882
[ Laughter ]

00:02:29.882 --> 00:02:32.184
And finally, according
to the latest numbers,

00:02:32.184 --> 00:02:34.386
this year, over
48 million American tourists

00:02:34.386 --> 00:02:36.189
are expected
to visit New York City...

00:02:36.189 --> 00:02:39.892
which explains why that Times
Square Dora just bought a yacht.

00:02:39.892 --> 00:02:40.893
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.893 --> 00:02:43.429
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

